<div class="page-hero--left" style="background-image:url({% imageUrl "chayce-discovery-hero.jpg" %});{% imageSet "chayce-discovery-hero.jpg" %};background-size:cover;background-position:center;">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / <em>Discovery Consultation</em></p>
    <h1><em>Discovery Consultation</em></h1>
    <p style="color:#ccc;margin-top:10px;font-size:16px;">Expert guidance and a personalised move plan</p>
  </div>
</div>
<section class="page-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="pkg-detail-head">
      <p class="pkg-detail-eyebrow">Not Sure Where to Start?</p>
      <h2 class="pkg-detail-title">Discovery Consultation</h2>
      <p class="pkg-detail-sub">Expert guidance and a personalised move plan</p>
    </div>
    <div class="pkg-detail-grid">
      <div class="pkg-narrative">
        <p class="pkg-section-label">What&rsquo;s Included</p>
        <ul class="pkg-feature-list">
          <li><span class="badge"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 12l5 5L20 6"/></svg></span><span>1-hour telephone or in-person consultation</span></li>
          <li><span class="badge"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 12l5 5L20 6"/></svg></span><span>Full assessment of your relocation needs</span></li>
          <li><span class="badge"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 12l5 5L20 6"/></svg></span><span>Personalised move plan document</span></li>
          <li><span class="badge"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 12l5 5L20 6"/></svg></span><span>Recommended timeline and budget breakdown</span></li>
          <li><span class="badge"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 12l5 5L20 6"/></svg></span><span>Priority access to our full-service packages</span></li>
        </ul>
        <div class="pkg-ideal-box">
          <h4>Ideal for</h4>
          <p>The natural starting point if you&rsquo;re not sure which level of support you need &mdash; we&rsquo;ll help determine the right approach, with no obligation to book anything further.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <aside class="pkg-order-card">
        <h3 class="oc-name">Discovery Consultation</h3>
        <div class="oc-price">From £150</div>
        <a href="/get-started/index.html?package=Discovery%20Consultation%20%E2%80%94%20%C2%A3150" class="btn-chayce">Book a Consultation</a>
        <div class="oc-steps">
          <div class="oc-step"><span class="n">1</span><span>Send your details</span></div>
          <div class="oc-step"><span class="n">2</span><span>We&rsquo;ll call within one working day to arrange your consultation.</span></div>
        </div>
        <p class="pkg-cross-link">Already know what you need? <a href="/packages/">Compare all packages &rarr;</a></p>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="page-section grey">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="why-start-row">
      <div class="why-start-item"><span class="num">01</span><h4>No wrong door</h4><p>Whatever stage you&rsquo;re at &mdash; still deciding, mid-sale, or already holding keys &mdash; this is the right place to start.</p></div>
      <div class="why-start-item"><span class="num">02</span><h4>A real plan, not a guess</h4><p>You leave with a written move plan, a recommended timeline and a budget breakdown, not a verbal estimate.</p></div>
      <div class="why-start-item"><span class="num">03</span><h4>No obligation</h4><p>It&rsquo;s a standalone consultation &mdash; there&rsquo;s no pressure to book anything further afterward.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="page-section">
  <div class="container" style="max-width:820px">
    <div class="pkg-journey">
      <h3>Inside a Discovery Consultation</h3>
      <ul class="pkg-journey-steps">
        <li><span class="jn">1</span><span class="jt"><strong>First 15 minutes &mdash; understanding your situation</strong><span>We talk through your current home, timeline, family circumstances, and what's actually driving the move.</span></span></li>
        <li><span class="jn">2</span><span class="jt"><strong>Next 25 minutes &mdash; walking through your options</strong><span>We assess which level of support genuinely fits — from a straightforward, physical-move-only approach through to full concierge-level support — and why.</span></span></li>
        <li><span class="jn">3</span><span class="jt"><strong>Final 20 minutes &mdash; your personalised plan</strong><span>You leave with a move plan document covering what needs to happen and when, a recommended timeline, and a budget breakdown, so you know exactly what to expect before committing to anything.</span></span></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="client-story">
      <blockquote>
        <span class="qmark">&rdquo;</span>
        <p>&ldquo;After so many years in the same house, we knew the next move would be different, but we hadn't worked out exactly what we wanted from it. We used our consultation to talk through the type of home we were looking for, what we actually used in our current house and what the move would involve. Rather than rushing into a decision, we came away with a clearer picture of what the next chapter could look like.&rdquo;</p>
      </blockquote>
      <div class="sc-byline"><span class="sc-mark">DC</span><div class="sc-who"><b>A Discovery client</b><span>Discovery Consultation</span></div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="pkg-faq-band">
  <div class="container">
    <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
    <div class="pkg-faq">
          <details><summary>What does the Discovery Consultation include?</summary><p>A 1-hour telephone or in-person consultation, a full assessment of your relocation needs, a personalised move plan document, a recommended timeline and budget breakdown, and priority access to Chayce's full-service packages.</p></details>
          <details><summary>Do I have to book a full package after the Discovery Consultation?</summary><p>No. It's the natural starting point if you're not sure which level of support you need, with no obligation to book anything further.</p></details>
              <details><summary>How long does the Discovery Consultation take?</summary><p>It's a detailed 1-hour consultation, held either in person or by telephone.</p></details>
          <details><summary>What do I get at the end of the consultation?</summary><p>A personalised move plan document, along with a recommended timeline and budget breakdown.</p></details>
          <details><summary>Who is the Discovery Consultation for?</summary><p>Anyone unsure which level of support they need — there's no obligation to book anything further afterward.</p></details>
          <details><summary>Does the £150 count towards a package if I book one afterwards?</summary><p>Speak with your consultant during the call — they'll confirm how the Discovery fee applies if you go on to book a full package.</p></details>
          <details><summary>What if I only need a straightforward move, not the full consultation?</summary><p>If you already know your destination and just need packing and removals handled, you can go straight to Bronze Essentials instead.</p></details>
</div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="pkg-close-cta">
  <div class="container">
    <h2>Ready to book your consultation?</h2>
    <p>Tell us a little about your situation and we&rsquo;ll help you find the right next step.</p>
    <div class="btn-row">
      <a href="/get-started/" class="primary">Get Started</a>
      <a href="/contact/" class="ghost">Contact Us</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

